            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Chronic pelvic pain has a negative impact on quality of life, resulting in a tremendous cost of illness. This condition has a multifactorial etiology and its treatment is often a frustrating experience for patients and therapists alike. Therefore, patients frequently initiate alternative medical treatment methods, which are explained below.</AbstractText>
